{"step_index":98,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-30T20:18:48Z","thinking":"Planning the interactive Web UI templates is the next step. Need to define the structure for key pages. The templates required include the public verification portal with lookup, badge display and testing, alongside the institution dashboard for credential management.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":":root {\n    --primary: #2563eb;\n    --primary-dark: #1d4ed8;\n    --primary-light: #60a5fa;\n    --secondary: #0f172a;\n    --accent: #10b981;\n    --danger: #ef4444;\n    --warning: #f59e0b;\n    --bg-main: #f8fafc;\n    --card-bg: #ffffff;\n    --text-main: #1e293b;\n    --text-muted: #64748b;\n    --border: #e2e8f0;\n    --shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.01);\n    --shadow-lg: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n}\n\n* {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n}\n\nbody {\n    background-color: var(--bg-main);\n    color: var(--text-main);\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n/* Navbar */\n.navbar {\n    background: #0f172a;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 1rem 2rem;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n}\n\n.nav-brand {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.nav-brand .badge {\n    background: #3b82f6;\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.nav-links {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.nav-link {\n    color: #94a3b8;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    transition: color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active {\n    color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.btn-nav-action {\n    background: #2563eb;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    transition: background 0.2s;\n}\n\n.btn-nav-action:hover {\n    background: #1d4ed8;\n}\n\n/* Main Container */\n.container {\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 2rem auto;\n    padding: 0 1.5rem;\n    flex: 1;\n}\n\n/* Hero Section */\n.hero {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n}\n\n.hero h1 {\n    font-size: 2.25rem;\n    color: #0f172a;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n.hero p {\n    color: #64748b;\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n/* Verification Search Box */\n.search-card {\n    background: var(--card-bg);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 2rem;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    max-width: 750px;\n    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem auto;\n}\n\n.input-group {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.input-control {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 0.85rem 1.2rem;\n    border: 2px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    outline: none;\n    transition: border-color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.input-control:focus {\n    border-color: var(--primary);\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n    background: var(--primary);\n    color: white;\n    padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n    background: var(--primary-dark);\n}\n\n.btn-primary:active {\n    transform: scale(0.98);\n}\n\n/* Quick Test Buttons */\n.quick-tests {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.chip-btn {\n    background: #e0e7ff;\n    color: #3730a3;\n    border: 1px solid #c7d2fe;\n    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.chip-btn:hover {\n    background: #c7d2fe;\n}\n\n.chip-btn.revoked {\n    background: #fee2e2;\n    color: #991b1b;\n    border-color: #fecaca;\n}\n\n.chip-btn.revoked:hover {\n    background: #fecaca;\n}\n\n/* Result Card */\n.result-card {\n    background: white;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 2rem;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n    border-left: 8px solid var(--border);\n    display: none;\n    animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-in-out;\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n.result-card.status-GENUINE_AND_VALID {\n    border-left-color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.result-card.status-REVOKED_CREDENTIAL {\n    border-left-color: var(--danger);\n}\n\n.result-card.status-SUSPICIOUS_OR_ALTERED {\n    border-left-color: var(--danger);\n}\n\n.result-card.status-RECORD_NOT_FOUND {\n    border-left-color: var(--warning);\n}\n\n.result-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n    padding-bottom: 1rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.status-badge {\n    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n\n.status-badge.genuine {\n    background: #d1fae5;\n    color: #065f46;\n}\n\n.status-badge.revoked {\n    background: #fee2e2;\n    color: #991b1b;\n}\n\n.status-badge.altered {\n    background: #fef3c7;\n    color: #92400e;\n}\n\n.status-badge.not-found {\n    background: #f1f5f9;\n    color: #475569;\n}\n\n.credential-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.data-group label {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.data-group p {\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #0f172a;\n}\n\n.hash-box {\n    background: #f8fafc;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    font-family: monospace;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: #475569;\n    word-break: break-all;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n/* Tables & Dashboard */\n.data-table-container {\n    background: white;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.data-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    text-align: left;\n}\n\n.data-table th {\n    background: #f8fafc;\n    padding: 1rem;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.data-table td {\n    padding: 1rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n}\n\n.data-table tr:hover {\n    background: #f1f5f9;\n}\n\n/* Footer */\nfooter {\n    background: #0f172a;\n    color: #94a3b8;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    margin-top: auto;\n}\n","Description":"Create style.css for web application UI","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Madziva\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\qualification-verification-system\\src\\main\\resources\\static\\css\\style.css","toolAction":"Creating style.css","toolSummary":"Create style.css"}}]}
